(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[689]={"source_order":689,"notes":["It is uncertain whether the folio numeral '345' is in pencil or faint ink.","A fragment of the facing page (fol. [344b]) is visible at the left, x≈0–400. It is ruled and blank, and is not recorded as a target-page block.","The gutter edge lies at about x≈390–440. The page extends right to about x≈3170 and from y≈325 to y≈4865 in native coordinates.","I reviewed the overview and all six native tiles, covering the top, middle and bottom, the gutter and outer margins, and the space between the lines. No catalogue text, cross-reference, heading, continuation note or marginal addition is present. The only writing is the folio numeral '345' at the top right.","The page is printed with horizontal ruled lines and a vertical margin rule at about x≈905.","Several marks are not writing. There is a small dark spot at about [745,2662,25,25] in the left margin column. There is a faint grey blot at about [1765,2710,65,60] in the main column. Diagonal crease and fold marks cross the top right corner at about [2400,330,770,720]. A small folded or torn corner sits at the bottom gutter edge at about [425,4820,95,50]. A faint diagonal crease is also visible near the lower right, at about x≈2850–3010 and y≈4470–4720.","At the left edge, x≈0–400, a strip of the facing page (source order 688, fol. [344b]) is visible. It is ruled and blank and is not transcribed as part of this page.","The adjacent page overviews were viewed for context only. Both fol. [344b] and fol. [345b] also appear blank.","The medium of the folio numeral '345' (pencil or faint ink) cannot be settled from the greyscale image."],"records":[]};
